      "source_text": null,
      "summary": "Declare by the end of junior year; complete the minor and major concurrently without extending the degree to finish the minor. Major and minor may not be the same program when minor courses are a subset of required major courses. At most 50% of minor credits may be double counted from major, transfer or advanced-standing credit, subject to stricter local limits. The university defines a minor as at least 4 courses/16 semester hours; background coursework may be extra.",
